text:
This looks like an arugula salad with a few pine nuts and some slivers of cheese or almond, on a square plate of about 25 cm. The greens cover a small area and are loosely piled. I estimate about 40 g of arugula, 5 g of pine nuts, 5 g of cheese slivers, and a little dressing or oil, around 5 g. That comes to about 55 g in total.

For energy, arugula contributes about 10 kcal. Pine nuts at 5 g add about 34 kcal. Cheese adds about 20 kcal, and the oil about 40 kcal. The total is about 105 kcal.

